curl-impersonate v2.2.3 (curl 8.22.0) + 20 security fixes from curl 8.23.0.
Apply AFTER patches/curl.patch from curl-impersonate v2.2.3, at -p1.
CVE-2026-107928 is GnuTLS-only and not applicable to this BoringSSL build.
CVE-2026-86411 is already fixed in the 8.22.0 baseline.

Upstream fix commits (curl/curl @curl-8_23_0, tests/ hunks stripped):
CVE-2026-92392 (HIGH, HTTP/2 upload UAF) 8b0744af5b1b631da5b938ca31c3f9895ad5a321
  - ported: 8.22.0 uses Curl_cpool_do_locked() not Curl_cpool_return();
    ev_data_done moved inside if(conn) before pool handoff (same semantics).
CVE-2026-107929 d37d79df1e01066417aff0a9e6bc675edad3edba
  - ported: conn->localdev renamed conn->interface_opts (field added by
    this same patch), host_input -> host_in in bindlocal.
